      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Offer a prepaid return label for immediate replacement while noting damage to your dispatch manifest as documented. This approach typically resolves the issue faster than a formal dispute, preserving customer loyalty and avoiding high fees. If replacement is unavailable, issue a store credit instead of a full refund to mitigate loss without outright denial.",
