      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Yes, denying the claim risks forcing a customer dispute that costs more in time and fees than a quick replacement. While the sensor data is valuable for internal review, offering a replacement or partial credit alongside a note that \"insurance or separate liability claims are pending\" is often the most customer-friendly approach. This allows you to de-escalate the immediate conflict without explicitly admitting liability in the interaction, protecting both the customer relationship and your bottom line.",
